text = "Numerle Puzzle:
To solve this puzzle, you need to figure out and order a set of three numbers correctly. This
puzzle will give you clues to do this, such as telling you when you have entered a correct 
number, and when that number is in the correct spot. 
When you've entered a correct number, it will be highlighted yellow.
when you've entered the number in the correct spot, it will be highlighted green and you can
no longer affect it."
